## Check

`kit/check.sh {UI DIRS}` -- FAIL on raw color, palette classes, pure
black/white, urgency, layout transitions, gradient text, saturated
faces, placeholder content, emoji, missing reduced motion, missing
promise, zh without a CJK face. WARN with reasons recorded here:
{list, or "none"}. `{e.g. src/components/ui/}` is exempt: it is
token-driven.

## Behavioral floor

Visible state, disabled-not-hidden, object then action, discoverable
then fast, verbs on buttons, undo over confirmation, modes visible and
escapable, honest feedback, trustworthy representation, keyboard and
assistive parity. A change against any of these runs the verdict
first: protected functions, counted evidence, behavior, then better /
different / costume.
